{"id":"a44f2e4245074d4a","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-gentzen.md","title":"NT 的 Gentzen 一致性结论","display":"thm-gentzen — NT 的 Gentzen 一致性结论","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-gentzen","aliases":["18-thm-gentzen"],"display":"thm-gentzen — NT 的 Gentzen 一致性结论","depends_on":["[[18-df-nt]]","[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","[[18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding]]","[[18-thm-cut-elim]]","[[18-thm-semiformal-soundness]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Theorem 7.5.9; discussion of formalization","source_pages":"125–126","source_pdf_pages":"135–136","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-gentzen"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-gentzen</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gentzen — NT 的 Gentzen 一致性结论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"251b8cab45b0242d\" href=\"?note=251b8cab45b0242d\" title=\"18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding\">18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"62c13ef1c5cb9a73\" href=\"?note=62c13ef1c5cb9a73\" title=\"18-thm-cut-elim\">18-thm-cut-elim</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"13e183157b0aa40a\" href=\"?note=13e183157b0aa40a\" title=\"18-thm-semiformal-soundness\">18-thm-semiformal-soundness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 7.5.9; discussion of formalization"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"125–126"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"135–136"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c5e56070c342728\" href=\"?note=0c5e56070c342728\" title=\"18-df-nt\">18-df-nt</a> 的一阶理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> 是该节点约定的普通有限一阶可证明性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a> 的无自由数变量公式集，允许自由集参数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg F\">\\(\\neg F\\)</span> 是普通语言否定，翻译到算术 Tait 语言时采用对偶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\neg\\bigl((\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F)\\land(\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash\\neg F)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\neg\\bigl((\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F)\\land(\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash\\neg F)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Theorem 7.5.9。书中由 NT 嵌入半形式系统、切消与假原子不可无切推导得到句法一致性，再用命题闭包得到此语义一致性。也可由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"13e183157b0aa40a\" href=\"?note=13e183157b0aa40a\" title=\"18-thm-semiformal-soundness\">18-thm-semiformal-soundness</a> 排除同时导出 F 和对偶。旧稿写 PRA+TI(&lt;ε₀)⊢Con(PA)，却没有固定记号代码、归纳公式类及一致性句；尤其“所有严格小于 ε₀ 的初段”与“沿 ε₀ 记号序本身归纳”不同。现在保留文件ID并改为原书可逐项核对的元层结论；印刷126页对象化草图尚未发展成本地完整编码定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-nt]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"251b8cab45b0242d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-nt-semiformal-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-cut-elim","status":"resolved","id":"62c13ef1c5cb9a73","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-cut-elim]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-semiformal-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"13e183157b0aa40a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-thm-semiformal-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-nt","status":"resolved","id":"0c5e56070c342728","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NT}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的一阶理论，$\\vdash$ 是该节点约定的普通有限一阶可证明性；$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 为 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的无自由数变量公式集，允许自由集参数。$\\neg F$ 是普通语言否定，翻译到算术 Tait 语言时采用对偶。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NT}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的一阶理论，$\\vdash$ 是该节点约定的普通有限一阶可证明性；$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 为 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的无自由数变量公式集，允许自由集参数。$\\neg F$ 是普通语言否定，翻译到算术 Tait 语言时采用对偶。","embed":false},{"target":"18-thm-semiformal-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"13e183157b0aa40a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应 Theorem 7.5.9。书中由 NT 嵌入半形式系统、切消与假原子不可无切推导得到句法一致性，再用命题闭包得到此语义一致性。也可由 [[18-thm-semiformal-soundness]] 排除同时导出 F 和对偶。旧稿写 PRA+TI(<ε₀)⊢Con(PA)，却没有固定记号代码、归纳公式类及一致性句；尤其“所有严格小于 ε₀ 的初段”与“沿 ε₀ 记号序本身归纳”不同。现在保留文件ID并改为原书可逐项核对的元层结论；印刷126页对象化草图尚未发展成本地完整编码定理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg F","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\ \\neg\\bigl((\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F)\\land(\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash\\neg F)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"c78f3207eb79266e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第二式由第一式直接推出：假设空相继式有证明，切消给出其无切证明，违反另一条件。修正旧稿把尚未定义的 PA 双边演算当成既定对象的做法。原书 NT 的一致性实际用单边半形式系统和空公式集，见 [[18-thm-gentzen]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-gentzen]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-gentzen]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-135","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-gentzen|18-thm-gentzen]]"}],"outgoing":["0c5e56070c342728","7ddb1b71680edcd2","251b8cab45b0242d","62c13ef1c5cb9a73","13e183157b0aa40a"]}